<title>CHINA: Dajiang '96 net down 39.49 pct.</title>
<headline>Dajiang '96 net down 39.49 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1995 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover	   2,525.1	  vs	  2,552.9</p>
<p> Net profit	  118.72	  vs	  196.19</p>
<p> Net asset per share     2.09 yuan    vs    1.99 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share	0.255 yuan   vs    0.388 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Dajiang (Group) Co Ltd</p>
<p>Note: The results were published in a company statement. The net profit numbers are based on international accounting standards, other figures are based on domestic accounting standards.</p>
<p>Based on domestic accounting standards, the 1996 net profit was 130.8 million yuan against 198.9 million yuan in 1995.</p>
<p>The company's board of directors proposed a 0.15 yuan cash dividend per share, pending approval of a shareholders' meeting on May 20.</p>
</text>
